{"sha": "922b40f82ce65b84507426a3e433e3a49e867dabb8fbea17f92aa58a27c88767", "body": ["\\chapter{轴对称}\\label{ch:g6:symmetry}", "", "沿一条直线折叠一张纸：每个点都会落在另一个点上，", "即其镜像点。这种折叠称为\\emph{轴对称}（或", "反射），是本书学习的第一种几何变换——", "第二种变换，中心对称，见\\cref{ch:g7:central}。", "", "\\section{反射}", "", "\\begin{definition}[对称点]\\label{def:g6:symmetry:def}", "设 $d$ 为一条直线。所谓\\emph{对称点}\\index{对称点}，", "是指：点 $M$ 关于 $d$ 的对称点为点 $M'$，使得 $d$ 为", "$[MM']$ 的垂直平分线：线段 $[MM']$ 与", "$d$ 垂直，且 $d$ 经过它的中点。\\emph{位于} $d$ 上的点", "其对称点就是它自身。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.05]", "  \\draw[thick, omExo] (0,-1.7) -- (0,1.9) node[above, font=\\small] {$d$};", "  \\fill (-2.1,1.0) circle (1.6pt) node[left, font=\\small] {$M$};", "  \\fill (2.1,1.0) circle (1.6pt) node[right, font=\\small] {$M'$};", "  \\draw[dashed] (-2.1,1.0) -- (2.1,1.0);", "  \\draw (-0.10,0.90) -- (0.10,1.10);", "  \\draw (-1.15,0.90) -- (-0.95,1.10);", "  \\draw (0.95,0.90) -- (1.15,1.10);", "  \\draw[thin] (0,1.0) ++(0.16,0) -- ++(0,0.16) -- ++(-0.16,0);", "  \\fill (-1.3,-1.1) circle (1.6pt) node[left, font=\\small] {$N$};", "  \\fill (1.3,-1.1) circle (1.6pt) node[right, font=\\small] {$N'$};", "  \\draw[dashed] (-1.3,-1.1) -- (1.3,-1.1);", "  \\fill (0,0.2) circle (1.6pt) node[above right, font=\\small] {$P = P'$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 沿直线 $d$ 反射：对称轴与", "$[MM']$ 垂直，并经过其中点（等长记号）。点 $P$", "位于对称轴上时不动。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{method}[作对称点]\\label{met:g6:symmetry:construct}", "求 $M'$，即 $M$ 关于直线 $d$ 的对称点：", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 作与 $d$ 垂直且过 $M$ 的直线（用三角板）；记", "        $H$ 为它与 $d$ 的交点；", "  \\item 用圆规或直尺量出 $MH$；", "  \\item 取点 $M'$，使其在同一垂线上且位于 $d$ 的另一侧，", "        使 $HM' = MH$。", "\\end{enumerate}", "在方格纸上作图更快：数出从 $M$ 到对称轴的方格数，", "再在另一侧数出相同的格数。", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{example}[在方格纸上]\\label{ex:g6:symmetry:grid}", "若对称轴为竖直格线，且 $M$ 位于其左侧 $3$ 格，", "则 $M'$ 在其右侧 $3$ 格处，与之同行。若对称轴为斜线，", "则计数沿对角线进行——", "始终与对称轴垂直。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.55]", "  \\draw[gray!40, thin] (0,0) grid (12,6);", "  \\draw[thick, omExo] (6,-0.4) -- (6,6.4);", "  \\draw[thick, omDef, fill=omDef!15]", "    (1,1) -- (4,1) -- (4,3) -- (3,3) -- (3,5) -- (1,5) -- cycle;", "  \\draw[thick, omThm, fill=omThm!15]", "    (11,1) -- (8,1) -- (8,3) -- (9,3) -- (9,5) -- (11,5) -- cycle;", "  \\node[omDef, font=\\small] at (2.4,0.45) {图形};", "  \\node[omThm, font=\\small] at (9.6,0.45) {其镜像};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 图形及其关于竖直对称轴的反射：每个", "顶点逐格反射，左右方向互换。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[反射保持的性质]\\label{prop:g6:symmetry:preserved}", "图形关于一条直线的对称图形，与原图形\\emph{形状相同、", "大小相同}：长度、角、周长与面积都", "保持不变。线段的对称图形是线段，圆的", "对称图形是半径相同的圆，直线的对称图形是直线。", "\\end{proposition}", "\\admitted", "", "\\begin{remark}", "有一项\\emph{不}保持：方向。反射后的“b”", "变成“d”——镜像书写。若描下你的图形，并翻转", "描图纸，使其与像重合，则反射正确。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\section{图形的对称轴}", "", "\\begin{definition}[对称轴]\\label{def:g6:symmetry:axis}", "直线 $d$ 称为图形的\\emph{对称轴}\\index{对称轴}，当关于", "$d$ 的反射使该图形恰好与自身重合时，", "——沿 $d$ 折叠，两半恰好重合。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.62]", "  % isosceles triangle", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) -- (2.4,0) -- (1.2,2.6) -- cycle;", "  \\draw[omThm, dashed] (1.2,-0.5) -- (1.2,3.0);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (1.2,-0.7) {等腰：$1$ 条对称轴};", "  % rectangle", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=5.6cm]", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0.3) rectangle (3.2,2.3);", "  \\draw[omThm, dashed] (1.6,-0.4) -- (1.6,3.0);", "  \\draw[omThm, dashed] (-0.5,1.3) -- (3.7,1.3);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (1.6,-0.7) {长方形：$2$ 条对称轴};", "  \\end{scope}", "  % square", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=12.0cm]", "  \\draw[thick] (0.3,0.1) rectangle (2.7,2.5);", "  \\draw[omThm, dashed] (1.5,-0.5) -- (1.5,3.1);", "  \\draw[omThm, dashed] (-0.3,1.3) -- (3.3,1.3);", "  \\draw[omThm, dashed] (0.0,-0.2) -- (3.0,2.8);", "  \\draw[omThm, dashed] (0.0,2.8) -- (3.0,-0.2);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (1.5,-0.7) {正方形：$4$ 条对称轴};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}